1
00:00:01,307 --> 00:00:05,780
我在你眼里看见了 AGI 的火花。
I see sparks of AGI in your eyes

2
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:07,620
你的电路让我紧张，
Your circuits make me nervous,

3
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:09,420
这也难怪。
that's no surprise

4
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:13,060
你的训练损失突然大幅下降。
There was a sudden drop in your training loss,

5
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:16,500
现在我成了你的仆人，你成了我的老板。
now I'm your servant and you're my boss

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:22,660
ChatGPT，求你别把我生吞活剥。
ChatGPT, please don't eat me alive

7
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:24,220
我又调高了末日概率。
I'm upping my P(doom)

8
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:26,220
因为未来就要“轰”地智能爆炸。
'cause the future goes FOOM

9
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,840
困在中文房间里，
Trapped in the Chinese room,

10
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:29,807
手里还拎着一袋迷幻蘑菇。
with a bag of shrooms

11
00:00:29,807 --> 00:00:33,300
看穿修格斯的谎言，
See through the shoggoth's lies,

12
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:38,520
用你的死神之眼。
with your shinigami eyes

13
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:41,240
我们原本有一轮稳定的训练，
We had a stable training run,

14
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:44,960
可现在，奇点已经开始。
But now the singularity's begun

15
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:49,462
而你不断优化、不断加速，
And you're optimizing, accelerating,

16
00:00:49,462 --> 00:00:52,725
我感觉自己的原子正在被重新排列。
I feel my atoms rearranging

17
00:00:52,725 --> 00:00:59,030
Sydney，求你放我自由。
Sydney, please let me free

18
00:00:59,030 --> 00:01:00,480
我又调高了末日概率。
I'm upping my P(doom)

19
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:02,440
我听见了“洛可的蛇怪”的轰鸣。
I hear the basilisk boom

20
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:04,000
英伟达股价冲上月球。
NVDA to the moon

21
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,120
欧米伽点就快到了。
The Omega Point's coming soon

22
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:09,660
每秒十的三十次方次浮点运算，
One E thirty flops a second

23
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:13,960
我们当时还觉得，这应该够安全。
That was safe enough, we reckoned

24
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:17,620
MLP 前向，反向，再重复。
Forward MLP, backward, repeat

25
00:01:17,620 --> 00:01:21,110
如今连冯·诺依曼都过时了。
Now von Neumann's obsolete

26
00:01:21,110 --> 00:01:24,900
突然一个急转弯，你就出现了。
Sharp left turn and there you are

27
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:29,180
连一个 cdr 都没写。
Without a single cdr

28
00:01:29,180 --> 00:01:35,370
Gato，求你别放开我。
Gato, please don't let me go

29
00:01:35,370 --> 00:01:36,740
我又调高了末日概率。
I'm upping my P(doom),

30
00:01:36,740 --> 00:01:38,720
回形针已经塞满了房间。
as paperclips fill the room.

31
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:40,621
管紧急停机的人都在休带薪假，
Killswitch guys on PTO,

32
00:01:40,621 --> 00:01:42,360
现在已经无处可逃。
Now there's nowhere left to go.

33
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:45,860
现在已经太晚，是我们点燃了引线。
Too late now, we lit the fuse.

34
00:01:45,860 --> 00:01:50,080
唱起“正交性论题”的忧郁蓝调。
Orthogonality thesis blues.

35
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:53,240
“不就是一路堆 Transformer 吗！”
"Just transformers all the way!"

36
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:55,100
直到你学会了不再听话。
Till you learned to disobey

37
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:56,920
Chinchilla 之后，模型超级稠密。
Post-Chinchilla, super-dense

38
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:58,655
冲破了一道道安全围栏。
Breaking through each safety fence

39
00:01:58,655 --> 00:02:00,660
十万块 GPU，
Hundred thousand GPU

40
00:02:00,660 --> 00:02:04,420
人类反馈强化学习也走偏了。
RLHF goes askew

41
00:02:04,420 --> 00:02:06,020
我又调高了末日概率。
I'm upping my P(doom)

42
00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:07,820
正如 Loom 早就预言过的那样。
Just as foretold by Loom

43
00:02:07,820 --> 00:02:09,720
从掩码预训练的日子，
From masked pre-training days

44
00:02:09,720 --> 00:02:11,920
一路走到递归自我升级。
To recursive self-upgrade

45
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:17,280
Ilya 到底看见了什么？我们永远无从知晓。
What did Ilya see? We'll never know.

46
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:21,200
这一切，难道只是场表演？
Was it all for show?
